0:{"buildId":"7TV3WSDnKGdgKVGmLMU3E","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Life abroad"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"07 Tips to Make Friends While You Study Abroad"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"While many of you may be thinking about studying abroad, if you are a person who does not like to socialize, then here are some tips for you that can help you become a better individual. It is an old saying, “Your character can be defined by looking at your friend circle!”. So it is really important for you to understand that socializing is a must for your career growth, especially when you are in a new place, but in the right way. Thus, making friends is not just a social activity; it’s a crucial part of personal and career growth. Are you ready to socialize and make lasting bonds while you are on your journey to advance your career? Then you must surely read these seven useful tips to make friends, which not only help you open up but also teach you a lot more things."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","07 Tips to Make Friends While You Study Abroad",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"07 Tips to Make Friends While You Study Abroad"}],[["$","p","Tip 01: Follow your Hobby:",{"children":"Tip 01: Follow your Hobby:"}],["$","p","By engaging in activities you love, you’ll be more likely to meet people who share your enthusiasm. Take up interests that interest you to meet like-minded people. A lifetime of friendships is built on common interests, whether they be in sports, music, the arts, cooking, or travel. “Every friend symbolizes a world within of us, one that may not have been born until they arrive, and one that is only created by this meeting.” Anaïs Nin",{"children":"By engaging in activities you love, you’ll be more likely to meet people who share your enthusiasm. Take up interests that interest you to meet like-minded people. A lifetime of friendships is built on common interests, whether they be in sports, music, the arts, cooking, or travel. “Every friend symbolizes a world within of us, one that may not have been born until they arrive, and one that is only created by this meeting.” Anaïs Nin"}],["$","p","Tip 02: Join Local Clubs or Groups:",{"children":"Tip 02: Join Local Clubs or Groups:"}],["$","p","Entering local clubs or groups focused on your interests is the next step after identifying what they are. You can look for these groups online, in the local paper, or by asking people in the area for suggestions. Doing activities with a group will let you meet people who like the same things you do, which will make it easier to start talking and make friends. Use platforms like Meetup, which host groups for everything from hiking to tech meetups, to find clubs that share your hobbies. Being in a club lets you meet new people on a regular basis, which may eventually lead to friendships.",{"children":"Entering local clubs or groups focused on your interests is the next step after identifying what they are. You can look for these groups online, in the local paper, or by asking people in the area for suggestions. Doing activities with a group will let you meet people who like the same things you do, which will make it easier to start talking and make friends. Use platforms like Meetup, which host groups for everything from hiking to tech meetups, to find clubs that share your hobbies. Being in a club lets you meet new people on a regular basis, which may eventually lead to friendships."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19"],"$L1a"]}]]}],"$L1b"]}]}],"$L1c"]}],["$L1d"],"$L1e"]}],"isPartial":"$@1f","staleTime":"$20","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L21","isPartial":"$@22","staleTime":"$20","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L23","isPartial":"$@24","staleTime":"$20","varyParams":"$25"},{"rsc":"$L26","isPartial":"$@27","staleTime":"$20","varyParams":"$25"},{"rsc":"$L28","isPartial":"$@29","staleTime":"$20","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@2a","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@2b"}
